== outside-written: a label the caller writes in an argument, read from a binding that uses the caller
   program `Y & (Y.a.h: <5)`, A := /(?<h>\d)/; B(rx) := /${[p = rx]}xx/; Y := [c = B([a = A])] SEQ "!"
   read Y.a.h
